ame to research, along with the Black Core Base, ability progression and item destinations. In a standard new game, energy points come from recycling: keep machines processing and send their output downstream, or switch their output to recycling to build up energy. Recipes and the encyclopedia show actual recycling values to help you compare production lines.Additions and changes","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:05:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692315","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063450-1845383656395951","game_id":"steam-5063450","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Black Core Opening, Research Guidance and Factory Visuals","summary":"Hello, factory builders!Since our last announcement on October 1, we have continued improving the Industry Unbound Demo based on your playtest feedback. This collection of updates focuses on the Black Core opening, Research Station construction, the factory canvas and equipment visuals, making your first goals clearer and everyday expansion and production-line inspection easier.Black Core opening and Research Station guidance• New games now start directly with the Black Core Base's dialogue bubb","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T10:36:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395951","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063450-1845383656382444","game_id":"steam-5063450","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update — October 1: Multi-World Canvas, 3D Planets and Scenic View Fixes","summary":"Hello, factory builders!This Demo update brings improvements to factory canvases, planet displays and everyday controls. You can switch between independent and multi-world canvases, explore industrial development through 3D planets, and get a clearer view of inventory, buildings and production.Independent and multi-world canvasesThe former Join control on the left has been replaced by two buttons: SOLO and MULTI.SOLO: View the current planet's factory canvas and focus on construction and product","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T17:01:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656382444","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063450-1844751498228510","game_id":"steam-5063450","kind":"update","title":"Demo Language Update: Now Supporting 8 Languages","summary":"Hello everyone! The Industry Unbound Demo has a new language update.Alongside Simplified Chinese and English, we've added Traditional Chinese, Japanese, German, Russian, Portuguese (Brazil) and Spanish (Spain). The Demo now supports eight interface languages.Choose your language in the top-right corner of the main menu, or change it in the game settings. Your choice is saved on your device and will be used the next time you launch the game.The translations cover in-game text such as menus, item ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-27T04:16:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498228510","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063450-1844751498226434","game_id":"steam-5063450","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update | Observatory Expansion Fixes, Colonization Guidance & Maintenance","summary":"Hello everyone, and thank you for playing the Demo and sharing your feedback!This announcement covers the updates from Build 25527348 to Build 25541744, with improvements to deep-space observation, megastructure maintenance, colonization, and population migration.Observatory Expansion & Megastructure MaintenanceThe Deep-Space Phase Observatory no longer requires a separate Deep-Space Phase Hub. Supply Phase Observation Units to the megastructure’s own ground interface and enable continuous const","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T03:14:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498226434","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063450-1844751498223819","game_id":"steam-5063450","kind":"announcement","title":"The Free Industry Unbound Demo Is Out Now!","summary":"Hello everyone!The free demo for Industry Unbound is now available on Steam!Industry Unbound is a single-player factory automation game set on an infinite canvas. Start with your first mining operation, connect production lines, organize logistics, and balance power as your small factory grows into an industrial network spanning multiple worlds.In the demo, you can:Design your own automated factory. Connect everything from raw material processing to research production. Find bottlenecks, improve","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T08:46:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498223819","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5063450":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:57:57Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:57:57Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5063450":"2026-10-26T07:57:57Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5063450":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:57:57Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:57:57Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fullte